{"about_the_game":"<strong>Humanity is on the brink. Mutant hordes are closing in \u2014 and survival means fighting together.</strong><br><br><strong>Hold the line. Or get overrun.</strong><br><br>Final Days is a fast-paced co-op twin-stick shooter where you and your team battle overwhelming waves of zombie-like mutants \u2014 often <strong>hundreds at a time</strong>. Hold chokepoints, cover each other, and unleash a storm of gunfire and explosions as the pressure builds.<br><br><strong>Fight back against overwhelming hordes \u2014 with hundreds of enemies on screen at once.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tear through relentless hordes, <strong>switch between powerful ammo types</strong>, and use explosives to control the swarm before it overruns you. Every run is a desperate push to survive \u2014 whether you're chasing high scores or simply trying to make it through the next wave.<br><br><strong>Control the chaos \u2014 or be consumed by it.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=414 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play solo or jump into co-op with up to <strong>16 players</strong> online, LAN, or local split-screen. Add bots to fill your squad, experiment with different strategies, and see how long your team can hold the line.<br><br><strong>Play solo or fight together \u2014 up to 16 players surviving the same onslaught.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/6d315646e6d50109e07cedc0448402e2.webp?t=1773934222\" width=107 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Survive overwhelming odds</strong> with hundreds of enemies on screen at once<br></li><li><strong>Play co-op your way</strong> \u2014 up to 16 players online or LAN, plus 4-player local split-screen<br></li><li><strong>Add bots</strong> to fill out your squad and keep the action going<br></li><li><strong>Switch ammo types on the fly</strong> and use explosives to control the chaos<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic environments</strong> \u2014 move objects to slow the hordes before they break through<br></li><li><strong>Compete for high scores</strong> on leaderboards and unlock achievements<br></li><li><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> by Chris Head<br></li><li><strong>Create and share custom maps</strong>, or play maps made by the community</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/d6d520da72cdfa380364dd6540314e49.webp?t=1773934222\" width=134 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Campaign: Rendezvous</strong><br>Your base has been overrun. Fight through 7 wave-based maps and reach the extraction point \u2014 if you can survive long enough.<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Escape</strong><br>Supplies are gone and the bunker is overrun. Push through procedurally generated levels where every run is different. Can you make it out alive?<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Depths</strong><br>Descend into Site 7 and reclaim the bunker from mutant infestations. Something new lurks deeper below \u2014 can you survive it?<br><br></li><li><strong>Last Stand</strong><br>Endless wave-based survival across a wide variety of maps. How long can you hold out against the growing hordes?<br><br></li><li><strong>Eradication</strong><br>Fight through endless procedurally generated bunker levels. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to your Final Days!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/85d2c9dae26b236c62151f0a344f66086a956f59.jpg"},{"name":"Rescued! (Bronze)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/ca9b3c700361a8afc23c52bff91ab850d5fa2c44.jpg"},{"name":"Rescued! (Silver)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/c35288fce75864b67aeece9f7ef075bf7f7403c3.jpg"},{"name":"Rescued! (Gold)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/df53fe00bebb1e4bd01771c3d45062f814b7074a.jpg"},{"name":"Rescued! (Platinum)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/3628ec2659b45a1acfbe00ba142f893131af56a7.jpg"},{"name":"Fire in the hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/c35288fce75864b67aeece9f7ef075bf7f7403c3.jpg"},{"name":"Bang for buck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/df53fe00bebb1e4bd01771c3d45062f814b7074a.jpg"},{"name":"Revenge from the grave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/df53fe00bebb1e4bd01771c3d45062f814b7074a.jpg"},{"name":"I'm taking you with me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/c35288fce75864b67aeece9f7ef075bf7f7403c3.jpg"},{"name":"Thinking outside the barrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/459830/ca9b3c700361a8afc23c52bff91ab850d5fa2c44.jpg"}],"total":115},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/459830?t=1773934222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773934222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/6d157ad2082eef9fd56d2b6431cd7e810d824d88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773934222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/6d157ad2082eef9fd56d2b6431cd7e810d824d88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773934222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":524860,"description":"Free Demo"}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Try Before You Buy</h1><p>You can download the <strong>free demo</strong> to try Final Days before purchasing.<br><br>Final Days is best experienced in co-op with friends. You can play online, LAN, or local split-screen, and <strong>bots can be added</strong> to fill out your team.<br><br>The demo is fully compatible with the full game, so you can jump into multiplayer sessions together.<br><br>As a solo developer, I really appreciate your support and feedback \u2014 feel free to reach out via Steam discussions or Discord.<br><br>\u2014 Mike, +7 Software</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Humanity is on the brink. Mutant hordes are closing in \u2014 and survival means fighting together.</strong><br><br><strong>Hold the line. Or get overrun.</strong><br><br>Final Days is a fast-paced co-op twin-stick shooter where you and your team battle overwhelming waves of zombie-like mutants \u2014 often <strong>hundreds at a time</strong>. Hold chokepoints, cover each other, and unleash a storm of gunfire and explosions as the pressure builds.<br><br><strong>Fight back against overwhelming hordes \u2014 with hundreds of enemies on screen at once.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tear through relentless hordes, <strong>switch between powerful ammo types</strong>, and use explosives to control the swarm before it overruns you. Every run is a desperate push to survive \u2014 whether you're chasing high scores or simply trying to make it through the next wave.<br><br><strong>Control the chaos \u2014 or be consumed by it.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=414 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play solo or jump into co-op with up to <strong>16 players</strong> online, LAN, or local split-screen. Add bots to fill your squad, experiment with different strategies, and see how long your team can hold the line.<br><br><strong>Play solo or fight together \u2014 up to 16 players surviving the same onslaught.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.poster.avif?t=1773934222\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.webm?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.mp4?t=1773934222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/6d315646e6d50109e07cedc0448402e2.webp?t=1773934222\" width=107 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Survive overwhelming odds</strong> with hundreds of enemies on screen at once<br></li><li><strong>Play co-op your way</strong> \u2014 up to 16 players online or LAN, plus 4-player local split-screen<br></li><li><strong>Add bots</strong> to fill out your squad and keep the action going<br></li><li><strong>Switch ammo types on the fly</strong> and use explosives to control the chaos<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic environments</strong> \u2014 move objects to slow the hordes before they break through<br></li><li><strong>Compete for high scores</strong> on leaderboards and unlock achievements<br></li><li><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> by Chris Head<br></li><li><strong>Create and share custom maps</strong>, or play maps made by the community</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/d6d520da72cdfa380364dd6540314e49.webp?t=1773934222\" width=134 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Campaign: Rendezvous</strong><br>Your base has been overrun. Fight through 7 wave-based maps and reach the extraction point \u2014 if you can survive long enough.<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Escape</strong><br>Supplies are gone and the bunker is overrun. Push through procedurally generated levels where every run is different. Can you make it out alive?<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Depths</strong><br>Descend into Site 7 and reclaim the bunker from mutant infestations. Something new lurks deeper below \u2014 can you survive it?<br><br></li><li><strong>Last Stand</strong><br>Endless wave-based survival across a wide variety of maps. How long can you hold out against the growing hordes?<br><br></li><li><strong>Eradication</strong><br>Fight through endless procedurally generated bunker levels. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</li></ul>","developers":["+7 Software"],"dlc":[937600],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/header.jpg?t=1773934222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/459830/169413/7ce63017969278aaf9b8176e0191fa60b99e4404/1751288554/dash_av1.mpd?t=1529566555","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/459830/169413/7ce63017969278aaf9b8176e0191fa60b99e4404/1751288554/dash_h264.mpd?t=1529566555","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/459830/169413/7ce63017969278aaf9b8176e0191fa60b99e4404/1751288554/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1529566555","id":256720495,"name":"Final Days trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256720495/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1529566555"}],"name":"Final Days","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Final Days - $4.99 USD","packageid":100105,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499},{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Final Days - Commercial License - $4.99 USD","packageid":355232,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Final Days"}],"packages":[100105,355232],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>O